<DOCUMENT>
<TYPE>EX-99.1
<SEQUENCE>2
<FILENAME>f6k1023ex99-1_brenmiller.htm
<DESCRIPTION>NOTICE FOR THE SPECIAL GENERAL MEETING TO BE HELD ON NOVEMBER 13, 2023
<TEXT>
<HTML>
<HEAD><TITLE></TITLE></HEAD>
<BODY STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;text-justify-trim: punctuation; margin: 0; padding: 10pt;"><DIV STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;width:600px;margin: 0 auto;">
	<DIV CLASS="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:right;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Exhibit 99.1</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:left;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;"><IMG ALT="" SRC="tbrenmiller_logo.jpg" STYLE="width:108.8px;max-width:100%;"></FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Dear Brenmiller Energy Ltd. Shareholders:</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:12pt;">We cordially invite you to attend the Special General Meeting of Shareholders of Brenmiller Energy Ltd. (the &#x201c;<FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Meeting</FONT>&#x201d;), to be held on November&#x00a0;13, 2023, at 4:00&#x00a0;p.m. Israel time, at the Company&#x2019;s office, located at 13 Amal St. 4<FONT CLASS="CharOverride-1" STYLE="font-size:58%;vertical-align:super;">th</FONT> Floor, Park Afek, Rosh Haayin, 4809249 Israel.</P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:12pt;">At the Meeting, shareholders will be asked to consider and vote on the matters listed in the enclosed Notice of Special General Meeting of Shareholders (the &#x201c;<FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Notice</FONT>&#x201d;).</P>
		<P CLASS="H2" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-indent:24pt;margin-top:12pt;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">Our board of directors recommends that you vote&#x00a0;FOR the Proposal listed in the Notice.</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Only shareholders of record at the close of business on October&#x00a0;30, 2023, are entitled to notice of and to vote at the Meeting, either in person or by appointing a proxy to vote their shares at the Meeting as detailed in the Notice.</P>
		<P CLASS="Text_ind" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">We look forward to greeting as many of you as can attend the Meeting.</P>
		<TABLE CLASS="No-Table-Style" STYLE="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 0px solid #000; border-width: 0pt; margin: 10pt 0 10pt 0;">


				<TR CLASS="No-Table-Style _idGenTableRowColumn-4" STYLE="height:12pt;">
					<TD CLASS="TB" STYLE="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;vertical-align:top;width: 59.40%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;" VALIGN="top">

					</TD>
					<TD CLASS="TB" STYLE="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;vertical-align:top;width: 1.28%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;white-space: nowrap;" VALIGN="top">&#x00a0;</TD>
					<TD CLASS="TB" STYLE="border-bottom-width:0pt;border-left-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-top-width:0pt;padding-bottom:3pt;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;padding-top:3pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;vertical-align:top;width: 39.32%; padding: 0in 0in 3px 0in;border-width: 0pt;" VALIGN="top">
